            <ArticleTitle>Surface anesthetic effect and topical tolerance of one dose 0.25% bupranolol in eye-healthy people.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>353-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In a randomised, prospective, parallel, double-masked study we examine the surface anesthetic effect of Bupranolol 0.25% in an oily solution. Bupranolol 0.25% decreases the corneal sensitivity to 23 mg/S, with the maximum between the 6th and 15th minute after application.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
